  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The\r\nproposed\r\ndevelopment, by reason of the proposed housing mix, specifically the absence of\r\na three (3)-bed unit, and its location with poor access to public transport would\r\nfail to achieve an appropriate housing mix having regard to the location of the\r\nsite and its surroundings, as well as evidence of local need which identifies a\r\nneed for larger family-sized units. The proposed development would therefore\r\nfail to contribute to the creation of inclusive and mixed communities, contrary\r\nto the provisions of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies H1\r\nand H10 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies HO1A and HO1B and HO2(1) of the\r\nHarrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;A\r\nPreliminary Ecological Appraisal is absent from the planning application\r\nsubmission material, which is required prior to determination. In the absence\r\nof such ecological information, the Local Planning Authority is unable to ascertain\r\nwith confidence that the proposal would not have an adverse impact on a species\r\nprotected by Section 41 of the Natural Environmental and Rural Communities Act\r\n2006 (NERC), the Conservation of Habitats and Species Regulations (2019), Schedules\r\n1, 5 and 8 of the Wildlife and Countryside Act 1981 (as amended), the ODPM Circular\r\n06/2005: Biodiversity and Geological Conservation – Statutory Obligations and\r\ntheir impact within the Planning System, and would therefore be contrary to\r\nParagraph 187 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy G6 of\r\nthe London Plan (2021) and Strategic Policy 07 and Policy GI 3 of the Harrow\r\nLocal Plan (2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the proposed subdivision of the rear garden into three separate amenity spaces, would result in a form of development which would be out of keeping with the prevailing character and appearance of the local area predominantly comprising of large detached family dwellinghouses and rear gardens, and given its siting to a corner, would be especially visible and detract from the appearance of the property, contrary to Policies GR1 and HO2(g) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
